# Raft Row Bazaar's Fixer Johnny and his strongroom (CIPlay raft_row_bazaar_talk, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): Johnny leans on a crate on the key at 12 47, east of the causeway's foot;
# his strongroom is a small concrete storey at x 16..22, z 47.5..56.5, its back door at 20.5 47.5 bolted until someone
# talked to him (talked gate); his three answers (journal, rope, the back way); the strongroom chest.
island Raft Row Bazaar keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
expect shown rbbackdoor
expect hidden rbstrongchest

# The strongroom from the key, the back door: bolted before anyone talked to Johnny
picture rb_strongroom_out 14 4 40 20 3.5 52
use rbbackdoor
expect message bolted from inside
expect shown rbbackdoor
expect hidden rbstrongchest

# Fixer Johnny, leaning on his crate
snap rb_islander Fixer Johnny 300 3.5 0.6
use Fixer Johnny
expect step 0

# Now the back door opens on the strongroom chest
use rbbackdoor
expect message Johnny's strongroom
expect hidden rbbackdoor
expect shown rbstrongchest
picture rb_strongroom_in 20.5 4 45 19 3 52 light=20
open Johnny's strongroom
wait 2
expect item Battery 1

# His answers: 1 the city (journal), 2 work (rope), 3 the back way
use Fixer Johnny pick 1
expect message who runs the city
use Fixer Johnny pick 2
expect message rope back with interest
expect item Rope 4
use Fixer Johnny pick 3
expect message back door of his strongroom is open
